{"route":"/docs/4.6/utilities/embed/","version":"4.6","renderedVersion":"4.6","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Embeds","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.6.2/site/content/docs/4.6/utilities/embed.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Create responsive video or slideshow embeds based on the width of the parent by creating an intrinsic ratio that scales on any device."},{"id":"about","type":"heading","en":"About","level":2},{"id":"about--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Rules are directly applied to <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;embed&gt;</code>, <code>&lt;video&gt;</code>, and <code>&lt;object&gt;</code> elements; optionally use an explicit descendant class <code>.embed-responsive-item</code> when you want to match the styling for other attributes."},{"id":"about--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<strong>Pro-Tip!</strong> You don’t need to include <code>frameborder=&quot;0&quot;</code> in your <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code>s as we override that for you."},{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Wrap any embed like an <code>&lt;iframe&gt;</code> in a parent element with <code>.embed-responsive</code> and an aspect ratio. The <code>.embed-responsive-item</code> isn’t strictly required, but we encourage it."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"506917cad849e87c0e2c","height":147},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zpOULjyy-n8?rel=0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"aspect-ratios","type":"heading","en":"Aspect ratios","level":2},{"id":"aspect-ratios--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Aspect ratios can be customized with modifier classes. By default the following ratio classes are provided:"},{"id":"aspect-ratios--code-1","type":"code","value":"<!-- 21:9 aspect ratio -->\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-21by9\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"...\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 16:9 aspect ratio -->\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"...\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 4:3 aspect ratio -->\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-4by3\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"...\"></iframe>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 1:1 aspect ratio -->\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-1by1\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"...\"></iframe>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"aspect-ratios--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Within <code>_variables.scss</code>, you can change the aspect ratios you want to use. Here’s an example of the <code>$embed-responsive-aspect-ratios</code> list:"},{"id":"aspect-ratios--code-2","type":"code","value":"$embed-responsive-aspect-ratios: (\n  (21 9),\n  (16 9),\n  (4 3),\n  (1 1)\n) !default;","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"506917cad849e87c0e2c","html":"\n<div class=\"embed-responsive embed-responsive-16by9\">\n  <iframe class=\"embed-responsive-item\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zpOULjyy-n8?rel=0\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/content/reboot/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/components/alerts/"},{"en":"Utilities","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/borders/"},{"en":"Borders","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/borders/"},{"en":"Clearfix","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/clearfix/"},{"en":"Close icon","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/close-icon/"},{"en":"Colors","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/colors/"},{"en":"Display","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/display/"},{"en":"Embed","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/embed/"},{"en":"Flex","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/flex/"},{"en":"Float","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/float/"},{"en":"Image replacement","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/image-replacement/"},{"en":"Interactions","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/interactions/"},{"en":"Overflow","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/overflow/"},{"en":"Position","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/position/"},{"en":"Screen readers","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/screen-readers/"},{"en":"Shadows","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/shadows/"},{"en":"Sizing","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/sizing/"},{"en":"Spacing","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/spacing/"},{"en":"Stretched link","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/stretched-link/"},{"en":"Text","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/text/"},{"en":"Vertical align","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/vertical-align/"},{"en":"Visibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/utilities/visibility/"},{"en":"Extend","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/extend/approach/"},{"en":"Migration","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/migration/"},{"en":"About","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/about/overview/"},{"en":"End of Life","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/end-of-life/"}],"standalone":false,"publishedAssets":[{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","integrity":"sha384-xOolHFLEh07PJGoPkLv1IbcEPTNtaed2xpHsD9ESMhqIYd0nLMwNLD69Npy4HI+N"},{"url":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","integrity":"sha384-DfXdz2htPH0lsSSs5nCTpuj/zy4C+OGpamoFVy38MVBnE+IbbVYUew+OrCXaRkfj"},{"url":"/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","integrity":"sha384-Fy6S3B9q64WdZWQUiU+q4/2Lc9npb8tCaSX9FK7E8HnRr0Jz8D6OP9dO5Vg3Q9ct"}],"sourceScripts":["https://cdn.usefathom.com/script.js","https://www.google-analytics.com/analytics.js","https://cdn.carbonads.com/carbon.js?serve=CKYIKKJL&placement=getbootstrapcom&format=responsive","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/jquery@3.5.1/dist/jquery.slim.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.js","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/js/docs.min.js"],"sourceStyles":["https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css","https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/docsearch.js@2/dist/cdn/docsearch.min.css","https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.6/assets/css/docs.css"]}
